# Offline twin note — pw-spin-gga
# True collinear spin-GGA PBE on O₂ (plane-wave NC-UPF).
# CP2K Quickstep is GPW/GTH, not NC-UPF plane-wave. Prefer Quantum ESPRESSO
# with tests/data/pw/O_ONCV_PBE-1.2.upf for an absolute e_tot twin.
# Geometry: O2 R=1.2075 Å, cell cubic 8 Å, multiplicity 3, nspin=2, GGA_X_PBE
# + GGA_C_PBE (true σ), ecut ≈ 12 Ry, Γ-only.
# When pw.x available: run fixed input and replace energy pin in
# regressions/pw/pw-spin-gga/REFERENCE.md.
